---
import '../../styles/music/header.css';
---
<header class="design-header">
  <div class="header-top-nav">
    <a href="/projects/" class="back-link">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to projects
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="header-main-content">
    <div class="header-titles">
      <h1 class="page-title">Music</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">
        Song writing, AI sound design and music projects.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="intro-cards">
      <div class="intro-card">
        <div class="intro-card-icon">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-music"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="intro-card-content">
          <span class="intro-card-title">Expression</span>
          <span class="intro-card-text">A moment of inspiration</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="intro-card">
        <div class="intro-card-icon">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="intro-card-content">
          <span class="intro-card-title">AI</span>
          <span class="intro-card-text">Helping me create music</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="intro-highlight">
    <div class="intro-highlight-icon">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-wave-square"></i>
    </div>
    <div class="intro-highlight-content">
      <div class="intro-highlight-header">
        <span class="intro-highlight-title">If My Songs Had Music</span>
        <a href="https://suno.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="intro-highlight-link">
          Suno AI <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="intro-highlight-text">
        I write songs whenever inspiration hits. Each one reflects what I'm feeling at that moment. No matter where I am, I pull out my phone, write the lyrics, and later use AI to imagine how they could sound as music.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="header-note">
    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>
    Select a song card to play. Use "Show Lyrics" to display the lyrics.
  </p>
</header>
